a equipada, proporcionando um ambiente completo para treinos.  \n- Espaço gourmet, ideal para momentos de confraternização.    \n- Brinquedoteca e playground, com espaços dedicados ao lazer infantil.  \n- Segurança 24 horas, com controle de acesso e monitoramento.  \n\nEste imóvel é uma excelente opção para quem busca um apartamento pronto para morar, com acabamentos sofisticados e uma localização privilegiada. Agende uma visita e conheça todos os detalhes deste empreendimento exclusivo no Ecoville.\n\nApartamento no bairro Ecoville.\nCom 109.53 m² privativos, possui 3 quartos sendo 1 suítes e 3 vaga de garagem.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/67dabd7846688a87e4685406/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9d74cbc4-5c34-4f41-bea0-b4adbbbf78f7.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/67dabd7846688a87e4685406/pilar-homes-images-watermark/2653b02d-01ab-471c-808b-ea0a0da7b482.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/67dabd7846688a87e4685406/pilar-homes-images-watermark/8e144f58-5c82-4a68-bd07-4799163e956c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/67dabd7846688a87e4685406/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1562649b-9b8d-4c85-ac0f-ab814fc857bb.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/67dabd7846688a87e4685406/pilar-homes-images-watermark/7dd3c9c0-6707-4952-87d8-d3c1bc59e330.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/67dabd7846688a87e4685406/pilar-homes-images-watermark/7f37ec32-e23d-41b1-80de-52c735ff04bb.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/67dabd7846688a87e4685406/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5441e60f-d33d-472c-9438-030fc113e4bc.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/67dabd7846688a87e4685406/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c9f4aeee-a850-46a4-9b11-2d9777c4b27a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/67dabd7846688a87e4685406/pilar-homes-images-watermark/332bdfaf-5781-408b-acb3-04d2c0077706.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sa